<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sergio Mattarella</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">b. 1941</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Sergio Mattarella is an Italian politician and jurist from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sicily">Sicily</a> who has been president of the Italian Republic since 2015, re-elected in 2022. A Christian Democrat, he entered politics after his brother Piersanti was murdered by the Mafia in 1980, served as a minister and later as a judge of the Constitutional Court.</p></div>
